        "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows\u00ae 10 / 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen\u2122 3 1200 / Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i3-6100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon\u2122 RX 560 / Intel\u00ae Arc\u2122 A580 / NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae GTX 950<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1920x1080, Graphics Preset &quot;High&quot;, 60FPS. 16GB RAM required when using Intel\u00ae Arc\u2122 GPU.</li></ul>"
